#: agent/src/backends.rs:275
msgid "The desktop is asking whether Rinflow may capture input"
msgstr "桌面正在询问是否允许 Rinflow 捕获输入"

#: agent/src/backends.rs:280
msgid "This device can't control others: the permission was not given."
msgstr "本机无法控制其他设备：未获得权限。"

#: agent/src/backends.rs:302
msgid "The desktop is asking whether Rinflow may control this device"
msgstr "桌面正在询问是否允许 Rinflow 控制本机"

